[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # If you sum the ith bit of all numbers and mod 3
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # it must be either 0 or 1 due to the constraint of this problem
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # where each number must appear either three times or once.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # This will be the ith bit of that "single number".
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # Use an array of size 32 to keep track of the total count of ith bit.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # Don't know why the array approach does not work
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # So I used the improved version
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # ones as a bitmask to represent the ith bit had appeared once.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # twos as a bitmask to represent the ith bit had appeared twice.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # threes as a bitmask to represent the ith bit had appeared three times.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # When the ith bit had appeared for the third time, clear the ith bit of both ones and twos to 0.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # The final answer will be the value of ones.
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # 使用二进制模拟三进制，在连续来3个1后清0
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # 使用两个bit位，bit1和bit2
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # 初始状态bit1和bit2都是0，即00
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # 在来了第一个1后，变成了01，来了第二个1后变成了10，来了第三个1后，变成了11，然后清0为00
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     # 即：00->01->10->11，然后将11清为00，这个过程就是我们编程的思路。
[36m(TaskRunner pid=2533906)[0m     def singleNumber(self, nums): end2prompt
